---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
const updated = 'September 25, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Website Terms | Post and Board Media"
  description="Terms for using the Post and Board Media website, including how enquiries, quotes and listed opportunities work."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Terms' }]}
>
  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="container--narrow prose">
      <h1>Website terms</h1>
      <p class="owner-review">
        <strong>Draft for owner review.</strong> These terms describe how the website works today. They have not been
        reviewed by a lawyer. Advertising and hosting arrangements are governed by separate written agreements, which
        still need to be prepared.
      </p>
      <p><em>Last updated: {updated}</em></p>

      <h2>About these terms</h2>
      <p>These terms apply to your use of this website, operated by {site.name}. They don’t cover any advertising or hosting arrangement — those are set out in a separate written quote or agreement.</p>
      <p class="owner-review">Owner review: confirm the legal entity name and governing law (for example, Ontario).</p>

      <h2>Enquiries aren’t bookings</h2>
      <p>
        Sending an enquiry or host application doesn’t reserve, book or guarantee any placement, campaign or space, and
        doesn’t commit you to buy anything. Availability is confirmed only in our reply, and an arrangement exists only
        once both sides accept a written quote or agreement.
      </p>

      <h2>Listed opportunities</h2>
      <p>
        We update listings by hand and aim to keep them accurate, but details such as status and available spaces can
        change. The written quote is the final word on placement, coverage, term, artwork support, scope, total cost and
        conditions.
      </p>

      <h2>Prices</h2>
      <p>Any prices shown on this website are in Canadian dollars. Where no price is shown, pricing is provided on request.</p>
      <p class="owner-review">Owner review: confirm tax treatment (HST) and payment terms for quotes.</p>

      <h2>No guaranteed results</h2>
      <p>
        Advertising results depend on many things outside our control. We don’t promise any particular number of
        customers, leads, sales, impressions or return on investment.
      </p>

      <h2>Example layouts</h2>
      <p>Images labelled “Example layout” show how placements may look. Businesses named in them are fictional.</p>

      {
        site.features.digitalScreensInterest && (
          <>
            <h2>Future services</h2>
            <p>Digital screen advertising isn’t currently offered. Registering interest doesn’t create a booking or obligation.</p>
          </>
        )
      }

      <h2>Website content</h2>
      <p>The site’s text, design and brand elements belong to {site.name}. Please don’t reuse them without permission.</p>

      <h2>Questions still to decide</h2>
      <ul class="owner-review" style="padding-left:2rem">
        <li>Cancellation and refund policy for placements and campaigns</li>
        <li>What happens when a campaign doesn’t reach its participation requirements</li>
        <li>Artwork ownership, approval deadlines and replacement costs</li>
        <li>Host placement agreement: term, display position, maintenance and removal</li>
        <li>Advertising content rules and prohibited categories</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
